From: Mieczyslaw Nalewaj <namiltd@yahoo.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Mar 2026 10:59:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: inside-secure/eip93: correct the ecb(des-eip93) name

The DES ECB template registers its driver name with the letters of "ecb"
transposed, so the fallback path and any lookup by driver name never
match.

Signed-off-by: Mieczyslaw Nalewaj <namiltd@yahoo.com>
Signed-off-by: Herbert Xu <herbert@gondor.apana.org.au>
---
--- a/drivers/crypto/inside-secure/eip93/eip93-cipher.c
+++ b/drivers/crypto/inside-secure/eip93/eip93-cipher.c
@@ -320,7 +320,7 @@
 		.ivsize	= 0,
 		.base = {
 			.cra_name = "ecb(des)",
-			.cra_driver_name = "ebc(des-eip93)",
+			.cra_driver_name = "ecb(des-eip93)",
 			.cra_priority = EIP93_CRA_PRIORITY,
 			.cra_flags = CRYPTO_ALG_ASYNC |
 					CRYPTO_ALG_KERN_DRIVER_ONLY,
